# Lilysplash Mentor: "Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d): only in its controller's main phase with an empty stack. Bot2's
# Ornithopter on the stack in Bot2's turn refuses it, Bot1's own second Ornithopter on the stack in Bot1's main phase refuses it
# even with the mana untapped, and the same activation is allowed in Bot1's main phase once the stack is empty (the control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Lilysplash Mentor
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lilysplash Mentor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
! Bot1.Battlefield.Lilysplash Mentor.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
! Bot1.Battlefield.Lilysplash Mentor.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Lilysplash Mentor.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
